-// Mode signatures intentionally change composition as well as palette. The
-// workspace remains recognizably TAHAI, but each mode should be identifiable
-// at a glance without asking users to decode a small accent-color change.
+// Mode signatures are professional cockpit systems rather than decorative
+// themes. Palette, geometry, typography, density, texture, and information
+// hierarchy vary by job while every surface remains recognizably TAHAI.
